Process credits
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

rock3r/android-ux-skills (https://github.com/rock3r/android-ux-skills)
  The motion standards and review process behind MOTION.md and docs/motion-review-*.md.
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0. No code from it is included in the app.

Circadian science
  The planner implements published phase-response curves and the Forger, Jewett & Kronauer (1999) and
  Hannay, Booth & Forger (2019) models of the human circadian pacemaker. Sources are cited in docs/science.md
  and docs/algorithm.md.

